{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，由於天水圍站有工程車設備故障，屯馬綫的列車班次需要調整，候車時間預計會比平日多10至15分鐘。港鐵免費接駁巴士將於稍後時間到達。<br/>\n<br/>\n目前來往屯門至元朗站預計要25分鐘一班，來往元朗至烏溪沙站8分鐘一班車。<br/>\n<br/>\n港鐵現正提供免費接駁巴士來往元朗站和屯門站，途經沿途各站。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:36:37.370010+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:32:43.302483+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T22:30:05.335762+00:00","content_hash":"7346623743c5d44864f7dbd30368bddb8cd69e97e215fd1344d7f497cfcacfd7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}